====================================================================================================
foldskew.c  internal dgraphFold() on a ring whose per-process vertex counts are drawn from a skewed
            distribution (seed; FOLDSKEW_EXTREME=1 for a few heavy processes and many tiny ones).
            Receivers check dgraphCheck(), the global vertex count, the sum of local counts and the
            sum of vnumloctax; prints "foldskew ... OK|BAD".
